    "created_at": "2019-03-13T15:50:12Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-03-13T15:50:12Z",
    "body": "It seems we can make it null at discard-time. The remaining question is how. Do we track all openees with a non-null opener browsing context so that when discarding happens we can clear all openees's opener browsing context? It seems like that should work?",
