    "created_at": "2019-03-13T15:59:12Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-03-13T15:59:12Z",
    "body": "Conceptually, you could do that, or you could just check at opener-get time whether the opener browsing context is discarded, right?  At least as long as we're talking about the script-visible opener.  If spec algorithms examine opener directly in some way, things are more complicated.",
