    "created_at": "2019-03-13T20:17:42Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-03-13T20:17:42Z",
    "body": "There are indeed algorithms that examine opener directly. I suspect those are wrong (instead those need to operate on a browsing context group and its top-level browsing contexts). Perhaps we ought to fix #313 first to make sure of that though.\r\n\r\nAnd currently discarded is not a state we expose on a browsing context as the assumption is that all references to it are cleared at the same time. I guess exposing the discarded state is probably a better strategy than all the additional bookkeeping my solution would take.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
