    "created_at": "2019-03-22T14:05:21Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-03-22T14:05:21Z",
    "body": "I forgot to add this here: I think the main problem with checking when getting is that then \"opener browsing context\" would have to hold a weak reference to a browsing context (since we prefer the specification to not have memory leaks these days) as well as a browsing context needing this additional state in case it's discarded, but not \"freed\".\r\n\r\nPreferences anyone?",
