    "created_at": "2019-03-28T21:08:56Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-03-28T21:08:56Z",
    "body": "I'm not sure I'm fully following but I think your original proposal is pretty straightforward. It would still be a weak reference in that direction, I think, but the architecture just makes sense. It's easy to understand the intent of the spec that way.\r\n\r\nBut I'm also OK putting this off until work on #313 is done or similar, and then perhaps working on a script-visible-only solution.",
